  "goodToKnow": "Die Bekleidung is clothing, a slightly formal or commercial word: Damenbekleidung, Arbeitsbekleidung, Schutzbekleidung (protective clothing). In everyday speech, people say die Kleidung or die Klamotten (colloquial). The verb bekleiden means to dress and, formally, to hold an office: ein hohes Amt bekleiden. Leicht bekleidet means scantily dressed. It has no plural."
